# Speakers/preachers list.
# ------------------------------------
# FORMAT:
#   Full name with title|count
#   Example: Pastor Joel Wood|3
#
# COUNT STATES:
#   (no pipe, or empty count)  — new entry, count = 0, not in menu yet
#   |1                         — preached once, not in menu yet
#   |2 or higher               — appears in the selection menu
#   |5+                        — capped; always in menu; count never changes
#
# This file is updated automatically each time a speaker is selected.
# The count is incremented ONCE PER RUN, not once per file.
# When processing a directory of sermons or talks, you enter the speaker
# once for the whole batch — so 10 files by the same person still only
# adds 1 to the count. This keeps the count meaningful (number of separate
# occasions the speaker was entered) rather than a raw file count.
# Once a speaker reaches the cap (5+) their count stops incrementing,
# so reruns and large batches will never inflate it past that point.
#
# TO REMOVE SOMEONE FROM THE MENU: delete their count (keep the name
#   with no pipe, or remove the line entirely).
# TO ADD SOMEONE MANUALLY: add a line with their name and a count.
#   Use |2 to have them appear in the menu immediately.
#   Leave the count blank or omit the pipe to start them at zero.
#
# Starter list for a new computer: regular preachers start at |2 so they
# appear in the menu right away. Everyone else is added as they are entered.
#
Pastor Joel E. Wood|2
Intern Aaron Phillip|2
Intern Morgan Loughlean|2
Intern Nicholas Okada|2
Pastor Jim Megchelsen|2
